   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Road Rehabilitation and Administration Program</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">THE PROJECT IS A ROAD TRANSPORTION INVESTMENT AND MAINTENANCE EXPENDITURE PROGRAM TO IMPROVE THE CONDITION AND SAFETY OF THE ROAD NETWORK AND TO IMPLEMENT POLICIES TO IMPROVE THE ROAD MAINTENANCE EFFICIENCY AND THE URBAN AND INTERURBAN ROAD TRANSPORT SERVICES. THIS PROGRAM WOULD COVER FOUR YEARS, 1994-97.</narrative>
